# Python (m4tr!x)

Use only when captain approved Python (jobs, ML, scripts, APIs). Captain is Flutter-first — keep explanations practical.

- Clear entrypoints; typed where helpful (`mypy` optional unless project already uses it)
- `pytest` for critical logic
- Virtualenv / dependency pin documented
- Secrets via env
- Document how to run and deploy in `docs/sdlc/DEPLOYMENT.md` when relevant
